{
  "fetchedAt": "2026-08-23 02:48:07",
  "synckey": 1787402777,
  "totalCount": 255,
  "items": [
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 234159446,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_4_2347-2407",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "2347-2407",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "过度依赖逻辑推理而排斥直觉感悟，过度强调理性分析而忽视情感体验，最终导致认知僵化，即看似洞察一切，实则失去对整体的感知。",
      "totalCount": 247
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 351960588,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_4_4649-4679",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "4649-4679",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "真正的强大，从不是让别人觉得你厉害，而是自己知道自己要什么。",
      "totalCount": 240
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 3381881,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_3_2453-2471",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "2453-2471",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "真正的成功应该是自我超越和必要满足。",
      "totalCount": 221
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 544305178,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_4_4742-4753",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "4742-4753",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "位尊实危，智者不就也。",
      "totalCount": 204
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 57449473,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_4_3688-3699",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "3688-3699",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "才高非智，智者弗显也。",
      "totalCount": 187
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 262752581,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_3_1084-1142",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "1084-1142",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "培养了许多在隋唐之际的历史舞台上扮演重要角色的人物，包括敢于犯颜直谏的魏徵、唐朝开国大将军李靖、唐初名相房玄龄等人。",
      "totalCount": 170
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 931365301,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_4_2157-2229",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "2157-2229",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "人类的认知能力受限于生命长度、经验范围、思维范式，而世界的复杂性、变化性是无限的。若强行以有限的智覆盖无限世界，则必然因超出认知边界而产生偏差，",
      "totalCount": 165
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 3582483,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_3_2331-2386",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "2331-2386",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "真正的智慧不是不断获取，而是懂得适时放弃；不是一味前进，而是懂得适当地停留；不是追求完美，而是学会接纳不完美。",
      "totalCount": 156
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 29838442,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_4_6968-7011",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "6968-7011",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "人生不必过度规划，小智执着于我要如何成功，在算计中焦虑；大智懂得水到渠成，在顺应中从容",
      "totalCount": 136
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 923356353,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_4_1889-1908",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "1889-1908",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "智慧达到极致，反而会呈现出愚昧的状态。",
      "totalCount": 126
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 923356353,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_4_2054-2102",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "2054-2102",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "但若一味追求“极”，即试图穷尽一切认知，掌控一切变量，达到绝对理性的顶点，则会陷入“愚”的困境。",
      "totalCount": 126
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 310105676,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_4_1754-1760",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "1754-1760",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "智极则愚也。",
      "totalCount": 120
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 228107867,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_5_2203-2230",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "2203-2230",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "无人能够垄断“势”的能量，亦无人能够阻止“势”的流转。",
      "totalCount": 119
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 318097606,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_3_2190-2242",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "2190-2242",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "作者就是要告诉我们，在什么时候、什么情况下应该停下来，正所谓“水满则溢、月圆则缺”，为人处世，当止则止。",
      "totalCount": 108
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 401652715,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_4_1661-1684",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "1661-1684",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "智者言智，愚者言愚，以愚饰智，以智止智，智也。",
      "totalCount": 108
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 422645674,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_4_1540-1546",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "1540-1546",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "智极则愚也。",
      "totalCount": 104
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 936573922,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_4_8684-8781",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "8684-8781",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "其一，不可尽算。人生充满了变量（如意外、他人选择、时代趋势等），再精密的“智”也无法覆盖所有可能。若一味“恃智”，当变化超出规划时，就会因失控而崩溃；“舍智”则是承认变化是常态，以灵活应对无常。",
      "totalCount": 102
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 39166987,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_5_3701-3994",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "3701-3994",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "势莫加君子，德休与小人。今译：君子不会依赖权势，而品德不要给予小人。评注延伸：此句通过“君子”与“小人”的对比，揭示“势”与“德”的匹配规律：“势”需“德”配，“德”勿予“小人",
      "totalCount": 102
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 38037358,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_3_2516-2591",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "2516-2591",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "正如书中所说：“欲无止也，其心堪制。”我们只有保持一颗宁静的心，不断地修炼自己，才能够在这个纷繁复杂的世界中，找到属于自己的位置，实现自己的人生价值。",
      "totalCount": 98
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300203101",
      "userVid": 344057561,
      "bookmarkId": "3300203101_3_856-907",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "856-907",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "那些既得利益者不愿意让一个年轻人打破现有的利益格局，因此，王通的建议虽饱含良苦用心，但最终未能被采纳。",
      "totalCount": 96
    }
  ],
